    "finding": "R10-1",
    "disposition": "FIXED",
    "evidence": "The reviewer's sketch alt10 is adopted: _repairer_inputs and its two call sites; the model equals the sketch apart from docstrings (the sketch markers removed, the _fail_scope and _overridden docstrings reworded). An exempt delegation carries only the child's repair; in its child, the other covered inputs it consumed stay covered. Vectors V209 (K1006, a revision reading the derived bytes, valid) and V210 (K1001, a delivery built on them, GATE_OVERRIDDEN; round 10 accepts it), with the stored children child-run-26 and child-run-27. The README's third bullet of 'A FAIL crosses the delegation boundary' states the narrower exemption."
   },
   {
    "finding": "R10-2",
